                           <div class="card">
                              
                              <div class="image-overlay"><a href="https://today.fresnostate.edu/the-big-fresno-fair-and-fresno-state-fight-student-hunger-on-fill-the-need-day/">
                                    
                                    <div class="card-img-top" style="background-image: url('https://marcomm.fresnostate.edu/images/homepage/latest-news/homepage-latestnews.webp');">&nbsp;</div>
                                    
                                    <h3>Fight student hunger on Fill the Need Day</h3>
                                    
                                    <div class="card-overlay">&nbsp;</div>
                                    </a></div>
                              </div>
                           The <a href="https://www.fresnofair.com/Tickets?target=_blank">Big Fresno Fair </a>and Fresno State are teaming up for the second annual Fill the Need Day on Thursday,
                           Oct. 15, offering fair admission for just $6 while supporting Fresno State students
                           facing food insecurity. For every Fill the Need ticket sold, $3 will directly benefit
                           the <a href="https://studentaffairs.fresnostate.edu/foodsecurity/student-cupboard.html?target=_blank">Amendola Family Student Cupboard</a>, which provides free food, hygiene products and other essential resources to Fresno
                           State students.&nbsp;<br><br><a href="https://today.fresnostate.edu/the-big-fresno-fair-and-fresno-state-fight-student-hunger-on-fill-the-need-day/">Learn more about the impact.</a>
                           </div> 
                        </div>
                     
